/532541/68802532541.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532541/5325410312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Coforge management presented an investor webinar on 'Operationalizing Enterprise Autonomy - Coforge Vantage Series,' focusing on AI-native transformation, enterprise context, agentic operations, data enablement, and outcome-owned engineering pods. The presentation highlighted operational metrics, including a 44% year-over-year increase in the 12-month order book executable to $2.23 billion for Q1 FY27 and a standalone EBIT margin of 16.7% for Q1 FY27, with total revenue CAGR over 9 years at 21.9%. Management also detailed specific client case studies across industries like travel, automotive, and healthcare demonstrating cost reductions, efficiency gains, and automated workflows. Coforge reported strong Q1 FY27 results with consolidated revenue of US$592.2 million and reported EBIT margin of 16.0%, driven by robust demand in AI-led engineering, data, and cloud services. The integration of the Encora acquisition progressed significantly ahead of plan with rapid realization of cost synergies and SAP S/4HANA migration.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects standalone Coforge EBIT to range between 16.5% to 17% for FY27.","quote":"We had shared with you that this year, standalone Coforge standalone EBIT will jump to between 16.5 to 17%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Management guided that the combined entity in FY27 shall deliver a reported EBIT of 15.5% or higher.","quote":"We had also said that we will immediately expand Encora margins too, and that the combined entity in FY27 shall deliver 15.5% reported EBIT.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is confident of achieving an EBITDA margin of 20.5% to 21% on a consolidated basis for FY27.","quote":"We are confident of achieving an EBITDA margin of 20.5 to 21% on a consolidated basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Free cash flow to PAT conversion for the year is guided to be 100% plus.","quote":"FCF to PAT for the year will be 100%+.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management stated that AI spend is entering its metered era.","quote":"AI spend is entering its metered era.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=86403cba-158f-4d53-9016-01cac46ddef7.pdf"},{"claim":"Enterprises are actively asking how to operationalize, govern, scale, and turn AI into measurable business outcomes.","quote":"Today, they are asking: “How do we operationalize it?” How do we govern it? How do we scale it? How do we turn it into measurable business outcomes?”","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the pipeline of large deals has never been stronger.","quote":"Our pipeline of large deals – short term, medium term and long term – has never been stronger than it is today.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"The demand tailwind for Coforge is described as structural and pure.","quote":"As we had shared last time, for Coforge the demand tailwind is structural and pure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"During FY26, the company invested approximately $58 million in AI innovation.","quote":"During FY26, we invested approximately $58 million in AI innovation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The combined organization reported a G&A of 6.6% for Q1 FY27.","quote":"The combined organization is now at 6.6% for Q1 FY27 from a G&A standpoint.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Hedge losses incurred during the current quarter amounted to $10 million.","quote":"The hedge losses incurred during the current quarter amounted to $10 million.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"The company recorded a Mark-to-Market loss of $14 million on outstanding hedges.","quote":"Additionally, we have a Mark-to-Market (MTM) loss of $14 million on account of outstanding hedges, which will be realized over the next two quarters.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Total order intake during the quarter stood at US$691 million organically.","quote":"Total order intake during the quarter stood at US$691 million.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"The next 12-month executable order book expanded to an all-time high of US$2.23 billion.","quote":"Our next 12-month executable order book expanded to an all-time high of US$2.23 billion, compared with US$1.55 billion a year ago—an increase of 44.2% year on year, providing strong visibility for the year ahead.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Total headcount at the end of Q1 stood at 46,228 employees.","quote":"Moving to our people metrics, total headcount at the end of Q1 stood at 46,228, reflecting a net addition of 10,451 employees during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"},{"claim":"Utilization remained healthy at 82.5% and last-12-month attrition declined to 10.4%.","quote":"Utilization remained healthy at 82.5%, while last-12-month attrition declined further to 10.4%, remaining among the lowest in the industry.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Exceptional expenses and acquisition-related expenses recognized during the current quarter amounted to $6.5 million.","quote":"Exceptional expenses and acquisition-related expenses recognized during the current quarter amounted to $6.5 million, compared with $5.4 million in Q4.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company remains on track to deliver EPS accretion in FY27.","quote":"As guided earlier, we remain on track to deliver EPS accretion in FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management remains confident of surpassing the 15.5% consolidated EBIT margin guidance shared for FY27.","quote":"Based on the progress achieved to date, we remain confident of not only delivering but surpassing the 15.5% consolidated EBIT margin guidance shared in the last earnings call for FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://investors.coforge.com/hubfs/Coforge_Q1FY27%20Earnings%20Conference%20Call%20Transcript.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company anticipates a positive impact of approximately $10 million in earnings from Q4 onwards as h